      <div class="wrap-content">
        
<ul class="breadcrumb">
    <li>Courts</li><li><a href="/courts/appellate-court/">Appellate Court</a></li><li>Third District</li>
</ul>
        <article class="main-content">
          <h1 class="page-title sr-only">Appellate Court Third District <span class="sr-only"> | State of Illinois Office of the Illinois Courts</span></h1>
          <div class="grid">
    <div class="column column-3">
        <div class="cta-card narrow cloneable">
            <h2 class="align-center">
                Opinions &amp; R23s
            </h2>
            <p>
                <a class="btn-primary btn-wide" href="/top-level-opinions?t=appellate&amp;d=3">View</a>
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="column column-3">
        <div class="cta-card narrow cloneable">
            <h2 class="align-center">
                Oral Argument Audio
            </h2>
            <p>
                <a class="btn-primary btn-wide" href="/courts/appellate-court/oral-argument-audio?d=3">View</a>
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="column column-3">
        <div class="cta-card narrow cloneable">
            <h2 class="align-center">
                Oral Argument Calendars
            </h2>
            <p>
                <a class="btn-primary btn-wide" href="/courts/appellate-court/oral-arguments-calendar/">View</a>
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="column column-3">
        <div class="cta-card narrow cloneable">
            <h2 class="align-center">
                High-Profile Cases
            </h2>
            <p>
                <a class="btn-primary btn-wide" href="/courts/appellate-court/courts-appellate-court-high-profile-cases/">View</a>
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div><p>
    &nbsp;
</p><p>
    The Third District Appellate Court is located in Ottawa and hears cases appealed from trial courts in 7 counties.
    <br>
</p><p>
    Circuits: 12th (Will),&nbsp;13th (Bureau, Grundy &amp; LaSalle),&nbsp;18th (DuPage),&nbsp;21st (Iroquois &amp; Kankakee)
</p><div class="row">
    <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
        <h3>
    Third District - Ottawa
        </h3>
        <p>
            <b>Appellate Court Building</b><br>
        </p>
        <p>
    1004 Columbus Street
            <br>
    ﻿﻿﻿Ottawa, IL 61350
            <br>
            <a href="tel:8154345050">(815) 434-5050</a>
        </p>
        <p>
            Zachary A. Hooper, Clerk
            <br>
        </p>
        <p>
            Hailey Rehberg Witt, Research Director
        </p>
        <p>
    ﻿District Population:  1,972,561</p>
        <p>
            <a href="https://ilcourtsaudio.blob.core.windows.net/antilles-resources/resources/1ad6c7b2-4886-4688-84c3-b209366afc62/3rd%20District%20Appellate%20Court%20Local%20Rules.pdf" target="_blank">Third District Local Rules</a>
        </p>
    </div>
    <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
        <figure>
            <img src="https://ilcourtsaudio.blob.core.windows.net/antilles-resources/resources/f6aefe10-fe3c-43fe-85d6-d1369780ed62/3rd.jpg" alt="district map of Illinois third district">
        </figure>
    </div>
</div><div class="cta-banner cloneable">
    <div class="content">
        <p>
            Meet The Third District Appellate Court Justices
        </p>
        <p>
            <a class="btn-secondary" href="/courts/additional-courts/chief-judges-and-administrative-staff/?t=appellate&amp;d=3">Learn More</a>
        </p>
    </div>
</div><hr><h3>
    Illinois Appellate Court Statistics Dashboard
</h3><div class="row">
    <div class="col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6">
        <p valign="top" class="align-justify">
    The Illinois Appellate Court Statistical Report Dashboard is a comprehensive summary of caseload statistic information sourced directly from the annual Illinois Supreme Court Statistical Reports for the years of 2021 to 2025.
            <br>
        </p>
        <p>
            &nbsp;
        </p>
    </div>
